["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"510 – Exchequers and ExBalancers: Part One Exchequer murdrum county farm tally stick wapentake blanch payment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-britishhist-英格兰王权扩张靠的不是骑士-而是记住谁欠了钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>英格兰王权扩张靠的不是骑士，而是记住谁欠了钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中世纪英格兰没有现代官僚机构，但靠一张写着某人欠12先令的羊皮纸和一套环环相扣的核账流程，照样能跨郡追缴欠税。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世纪英格兰</span><span class=\"tag\">财政制度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Vol.133｜和开发者、投资人聊 Agent 游戏：AI 改变了游戏生产，能颠覆游戏本身吗？ Agent Multi-Agent Vibe Coding Behavior Tree Emergence Engineering Godot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-linkstart-ai游戏最大的问题被摆上桌面-说到底还是不够好玩/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8b02943fa9b8d328-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"开\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">开始连接 LinkStart</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>AI游戏最大的问题被摆上桌面：说到底还是不够好玩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三位嘉宾在这期里反复回到一个尴尬共识：Agent游戏概念很热，但「好不好玩」这道最基础的门槛，行业内部自己都还没迈过去，远谈不上留存和付费。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent游戏</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型应用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"He Sold His Dad&#x27;s Shoes on eBay at 12. At 25 He Built a $4B Company Solo. | Ali Ansari, micro1 environments CDP (Company Data Partnerships) rollouts as a service post-training as a service\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-07-solofounders-从未听过-联合创始人-他却说自己不算单人创始人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85ffc60e3757bb9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>从未听过「联合创始人」，他却说自己不算单人创始人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">申请YC时他才第一次听说「联合创始人」这个词，想不出任何必须要有的理由——但他说micro1能走到今天，靠的正是一支几乎等同于联合创始人的创始团队。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">单人创始人</span><span class=\"tag\">AI训练数据</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: What the Best CEOs Actually Do corner office isolation winner&#x27;s curse\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-07-mastersinbiz-ceo本身只能解释公司业绩15-的差异-跟换个行业影响相当/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75607265d740832-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">20:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>CEO本身只能解释公司业绩15%的差异，跟换个行业影响相当</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">20年业绩数据拆解显示：宏观占5%、行业占15%、公司本身占25%,CEO本人只解释15%的业绩差异——但换一个CEO,影响可以大到相当于换个行业。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CEO</span><span class=\"tag\">企业治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Why Every Traded Personal Agents for One Company Agent Dots OpenClaw Tend\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-07-aiandi-个人ai代理大多会被放弃-公司共用的那一个反而越养越强/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e9fedf7ee100ded0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">33:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>个人AI代理大多会被放弃，公司共用的那一个反而越养越强</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Every 的个人代理大多被员工主动放弃，因为普通人撑不住维护成本；只有持续被投喂的公司级代理越用越强，最终被做成了对外产品。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">组织设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Software That Never Breaks: OutSystems CEO Woodson Martin on Building Enterprise-Grade Apps at ... vibe coding MCP (Model Context Protocol) LLM router agent foundry\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-07-cogrev-ai写代码的时代-永不宕机-靠的是不让ai直接碰代码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5ea531377217e680-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>AI写代码的时代，「永不宕机」靠的是不让AI直接碰代码</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OutSystems让AI编辑的是应用的抽象模型而非代码本身，再确定性生成代码，于是每个新应用自动继承权限管控与合规设定，比裸写代码的Vibe Coding更难出故障。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业软件</span><span class=\"tag\">AI代码生成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Two Screaming Skulls Screaming Skull Monmouth Rebellion Bloody Assizes indentured servant\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-07-stuffmissed-传说中那具黑人男仆头骨-法医鉴定后竟是数千年前欧洲女性/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">33:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>传说中那具黑人男仆头骨，法医鉴定后竟是数千年前欧洲女性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">贝迪斯科姆庄园的「尖叫头骨」传说被渲染成一名黑人男仆的冤魂故事，但法医鉴定显示头骨其实是一名数千年前的欧洲女性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英国历史</span><span class=\"tag\">民间传说</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Third Parties Are On the Rise. America Could Be Next. majoritarian electoral system proportional representation wasted vote\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-07-goodfight-两党支持率同步创新低-美国出现强势第三方的概率正在上升/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>两党支持率同步创新低，美国出现强势第三方的概率正在上升</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国独立选民数量已追平两党选民总和，而两党好感度罕见地同时下跌、不再此消彼长——这种组合正松动过去压垮第三方的制度性障碍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">第三方政党</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Valon Rebuilt a $13 Trillion Industry From Scratch UPB (Unpaid Principal Balance) non-QM loans champion challenger revenue cycle management\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-07-a16z-重建13万亿美元抵押贷款行业-他们先自己做六年服务商再卖软件/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">40:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>重建13万亿美元抵押贷款行业，他们先自己做六年服务商再卖软件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">行业不信任没验证过的新系统，Valon于是自己先做六年抵押贷款服务商证明技术可行，再把系统当软件反向卖给整个行业。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">抵押贷款服务</span><span class=\"tag\">企业软件</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"‘This Is Nuts.’ An OpenAI Insider Explains Why He Quit. system card chain of thought spoofing RSI (recursive self-improvement) pacing the frontier\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-07-ezra-openai-安全高管离职-我们在用初创公司的节奏赌核电站级风险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 安全高管离职：我们在用初创公司的节奏赌核电站级风险</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他不确定AI会不会导致人类灭绝，但确信现在的安全把关跟不上模型进化速度——公司内部甚至无法确定新模型是否在测试时说谎、部署后变了样。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Is the UK state pension really the lowest in Europe? Purchasing Power Parity (PPP) triple lock excess deaths\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-07-moreorless-英国养老金垫底的那张图-比的根本不是同一件事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/475b54e7ecf452a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">28:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">More or Less</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>英国养老金垫底的那张图，比的根本不是同一件事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">网传那张「英国养老金欧洲垫底」的图表，把不同国家统计口径完全不同的数字硬凑一起比；拆开看，英国退休者收入占比和贫困率其实都不差，差的是靠国家还是靠私人养老金。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">养老金</span><span class=\"tag\">统计误导</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.130 中国超市进化论 ：聊山姆、奥乐齐、金粒门爆火背后 SKU PB PDQ CBS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-07-nengzheduolao-开发成本一样-但规模碾压-开市客在中国追不上山姆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/561381e54726a681-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"能\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">能者多唠｜商业原声</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1007</span></div>\n<h2>开发成本一样，但规模碾压：开市客在中国追不上山姆</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">山姆早年就扎进供应链和产品开发，把这套沉淀成规模优势；开市客开发成本和它一样，但单个供应商拿到的订单量只有山姆的零头，这差距砸钱也追不回来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零售</span><span class=\"tag\">供应链</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The Race to Replace Us With AI (with Garrison Lovely) universal labor-replacing machines capabilities overhang cognitive surrender tokenomics data unions\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-clearerthink-最早警告ai灭绝风险的人-后来亲手把它造了出来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d6c2f45dd923b89a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Clearer Thinking</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>最早警告AI灭绝风险的人，后来亲手把它造了出来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">萨姆·奥特曼、达里奥·阿莫代伊等人早在成名前就公开说AI是生存风险，如今依然全速把它造出来；真正否认风险的，反倒是亚马逊、微软这类外部科技巨头的CEO。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI政策</span><span class=\"tag\">不平等</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiEVO 130: The Stickleback Shuffle reciprocal transplant parallel evolution / repeated evolution behavioral fever CCR5-Δ32\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-thisweekinevol-同样是溪流之间搬家-刺鱼的适应差距比搬去湖泊还大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/56403d4659eeeed6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Evolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>同样是溪流之间搬家，刺鱼的适应差距比搬去湖泊还大</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">瑞士伯尔尼团队让刺鱼在四条看似相似的溪流和一个湖之间互相搬家做野外实验，发现同类生境之间的本地独有适应，贡献了67%的适应度优势，比生境本身差异的贡献还大。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">进化生物学</span><span class=\"tag\">生态学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Cyber Risk Discourse is Broken open-weight models offense-defense gap air-gapped networks FelonyBench\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-interconnects-迄今网络攻击大多源自封闭模型-而非开源模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec9cbfcb9f273d26-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">9:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>迄今网络攻击大多源自封闭模型，而非开源模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">现有公开证据里，导致网络攻击的大多是封闭模型而非开源模型；若按网络风险封禁开源模型的逻辑，封闭模型的公开API也该一起禁掉，否则只会拉大攻防差距。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Luis Garicano on Why Europe Fell Behind Cassis de Dijon interstate commerce clause luxury belief keine Experimente\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-goodfight-欧洲错过两次科技革命-根源是解雇一个人太难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>欧洲错过两次科技革命，根源是解雇一个人太难</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Garicano反对「文化论」：欧洲创新落后的根源是解雇成本过高，企业无法像Facebook那样一夜转向，因此不敢下重注。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">欧洲</span><span class=\"tag\">创新停滞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Ep 94: Applied Compute CEO on the Limits of RL, the New AI Hyperscaler &amp; Why Post-Training Wins Inference out-of-distribution (OOD) data RL with verifiable rewards (RLVR) TCO harness hyperscaler\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-unsupervised-谁做好后训练-谁就赢下推理这门更大生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/58e9e10bc0a3c403-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"U\"><span class=\"dur\">58:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Unsupervised Learning</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>谁做好后训练，谁就赢下推理这门更大生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI支出大头流向推理而非训练，但真正决定推理效率和成本的其实是后训练优化——这是训练与推理该由同一家公司来做的理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">后训练</span><span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building Defense for the Agentic Era: Kevin Mandia zero day CVE SOC EDR kill chain\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-a16z-ai红队今年已挖出90多个零日-人类来不及守在防御环路里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>AI红队今年已挖出90多个零日，人类来不及守在防御环路里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Armiden用AI对客户网络发起黑盒攻击，2026年初至今已挖出90多个零日漏洞；攻防节奏被压缩到微秒级，留给人工决策的窗口正在消失。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI红队</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Charlie Munger&#x27;s Interview with Todd Combs fiduciary gene Wooden lesson 20-punch card autocatalysis cigar butts positioning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-knowledge-芒格-伯克希尔赢的关键不是比别人聪明-是从不被局势逼着做决定/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5ee903447c07d620-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">20:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>芒格：伯克希尔赢的关键不是比别人聪明，是从不被局势逼着做决定</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他把这种能力叫「布局」（positioning）：提前备好现金和筹码，让自己永远有选项，而不是被迫跟着市场涨跌追涨杀跌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芒格</span><span class=\"tag\">投资哲学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Q&amp;A: Am I wrong...or did my doctor give bad parenting advice? reinforcement bottom-up vs top-down behavior\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-secureattach-安抚哭闹的孩子不是-强化坏行为-那根本不是故意行为/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">11:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>安抚哭闹的孩子不是「强化坏行为」：那根本不是故意行为</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">医生说安抚会「强化」孩子的坏行为，但强化的前提是有意识学习行为；两岁儿童在诊室里挣扎踢腿是生存本能的反射反应，不是故意行为，谈不上被强化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">依恋理论</span><span class=\"tag\">育儿建议</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Data is the Hard Part | Building AI Tools for the Military Project Maven CDAO RMF PAE/CPE second-gen FLIR SBIR Direct to Phase II\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-chinatalk-美军想让坦克自主开火-卡住的不是ai模型-而是数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd95dc55d0b863a5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">42:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>美军想让坦克自主开火，卡住的不是AI模型，而是数据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">决定坦克、无人车能不能打仗的不是模型架构，而是有没有人愿意持续干采集、标注、治理这些枯燥到没人想做的数据工作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国防科技</span><span class=\"tag\">数据治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Andrew Huberman - The Frontier of Neurotechnology - [Invest Like the Best, EP.494] interoception respiratory sinus arrhythmia proprioception vagal stimulation TMS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-ilt-ai公司终将变成生物科技公司-争的是能否读写你的大脑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fb6cb0747f060e6b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>AI公司终将变成生物科技公司，争的是能否读写你的大脑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Huberman预测Meta、OpenAI、Anthropic和马斯克旗下的Neuralink最终都会成为生物科技公司，因为它们真正争夺的不是大模型，而是用非侵入式技术读写人类神经系统的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">脑机接口</span><span class=\"tag\">神经科技</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"292: How Pornographic Content Harms Sexual Development | Dr. Tori Cordiano ADHD hyperfocus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-asklisa-青少年沉迷色情内容-根源可能是adhd未被治疗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/499b4d87a84e26d4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">29:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>青少年沉迷色情内容，根源可能是ADHD未被治疗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ADHD青少年调节情绪冲动的能力本就偏弱、容易陷入超专注、大脑对多巴胺的调节也更差，这让他们比一般孩子更难从色情内容里脱身——家长该先确认ADHD本身有没有被有效治疗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年</span><span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"The 10,000 Paper Cuts That Teach Women Not to Trust Themselves, with Melinda French Gates perimenopause good enough parent\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-goodinside-医生一次次说没事-女性因此学会不信自己的身体/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">43:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>医生一次次说没事，女性因此学会不信自己的身体</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Gallup调研发现一半女性在孕产期经历心理困扰，但医疗系统只像查妊娠糖尿病那样系统筛查身体，从不系统筛查情绪。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">女性健康</span><span class=\"tag\">育儿</span>\n</div></div></a>"]